# Bot1's own Ancestral Recall makes it draw three; Bot2's Chains of Mephistopheles replaces each draw with a discard. The
# discard is the replacement effect's, so the ability of Bot2's Chains causes it (CR 614.1a, 609.1), not the spell Bot1
# controls - and Bot1's Tamiyo, Collector of Tales says spells and abilities its opponents control can't cause it to discard
# (CR 101.2). Bot1 discards nothing, so for each draw it mills a card instead: its three Islands stay in hand, and Memnite,
# Ornithopter and Tormod's Crypt are milled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
